Rule 1 (image must have either 3 or 4 dimensions)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = 3 ∨ ndim(v_1) = 4
>>
Rule 2 (inner 3 dimensions must be strictly positive)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = 3 then shape(v_1, 0) > 0 ∧ shape(v_1, 1) > 0 ∧ shape(v_1, 2) > 0 else if ndim(v_1) = 4 then shape(v_1, 1) > 0 ∧ shape(v_1, 2) > 0 ∧ shape(v_1, 3) > 0 else false
>>
Rule 3 (image must be at least three-dimensional)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 3
>>
Rule 6 (inner 3 dimensions (H, W, C) must be strictly positive)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = 3 then shape(v_1, 0) > 0 ∧ shape(v_1, 1) > 0 ∧ shape(v_1, 2) > 0 else (if ndim(v_1) = 4 then shape(v_1, 1) > 0 ∧ shape(v_1, 2) > 0 ∧ shape(v_1, 3) > 0 else false)
